01:06:40.274 --> 01:06:41.554
They aren't answering.

01:06:43.755 --> 01:06:46.256
They were all around her and then they disappeared.

01:06:52.677 --> 01:06:53.617
She doesn't remember.

01:06:57.599 --> 01:06:59.679
The mage shark is heading into a maze.

01:07:18.737 --> 01:07:19.916
