01:09:50.409 --> 01:10:00.000
A whole family is now gathering around the lake.

01:10:28.620 --> 01:10:30.042
In the Maitre's absence,

01:10:30.382 --> 01:10:32.525
the eldest daughter took control of the group.

01:10:33.466 --> 01:10:35.609
She is now guiding them in search of Emile.

01:10:52.840 --> 01:10:58.525
All these young dolphins were raised by the matriarch and she passed on an impressive fishing technique to them.

01:11:01.607 --> 01:11:03.349
You just have to follow the sound.

