01:13:51.072 --> 01:13:54.213
This is the oldest of all living things on the planet today.

01:13:58.275 --> 01:14:00.416
A plant called Posidonia.

01:14:14.786 --> 01:14:17.386
The oldest is over 100,000 years old.

01:14:26.287 --> 01:14:31.069
She stretches for several kilometers between the Balearic Islands of Formentera and Ibiza.

01:14:41.117 --> 01:14:41.917
The forest,

01:14:42.518 --> 01:14:44.738
