01:15:16.189 --> 01:15:18.251
She has extraordinary abilities.

01:15:20.533 --> 01:15:22.135
She stabilizes the seabed.

01:15:23.536 --> 01:15:27.019
She filters the water and gives it that legendary clarity.

01:15:29.984 --> 01:15:30.944
She absorbs CO2,

01:15:31.865 --> 01:15:32.765
stores carbon,

01:15:33.247 --> 01:15:35.529
and releases oxygen in large quantities.

01:15:37.590 --> 01:15:40.032
20 times more than a forest on land.

01:15:50.039 --> 01:15:52.823
But her virtues lead directly to her misfortunes,

01:15:53.963 --> 01:15:57.987
because the beauty that surrounds her attracts the most dangerous predators.

01:16:17.496 --> 01:16:18.136
Every summer,

01:16:18.896 --> 01:16:21.778
thousands come to enjoy the idyllic waters of Font Madera.

01:16:24.600 --> 01:16:27.502
Many people are unaware of this plant's qualities.

01:16:33.844 --> 01:16:35.284
Time it takes for her to grow.

01:16:40.829 --> 01:16:42.152
One centimeter a year.

01:16:42.931 --> 01:16:44.514
That's one meter a century.

01:16:51.619 --> 01:16:57.465
This is the damage caused in just a few minutes when a single anchor is dropped in the wrong place.

01:17:54.923 --> 01:17:56.345
She is covered in scars.

01:18:07.789 --> 01:18:08.430
As a result,

01:18:09.051 --> 01:18:11.311
Posidonia is disappearing from our coasts,

01:18:12.631 --> 01:18:13.672
