01:18:45.489 --> 01:18:47.010
turns them into breathable air,

01:18:49.132 --> 01:18:51.294
and welcomes all the life that needs her.

01:18:54.667 --> 01:18:56.047
This miraculous plant,

01:18:56.768 --> 01:18:58.509
