01:19:29.896 --> 01:19:34.399
Man's impact on the Mediterranean Sea has intensified in the last hundred years.

01:19:36.340 --> 01:19:39.402
Waste that ends up in the sea has become more polluting,

01:19:39.902 --> 01:19:42.704
