01:30:02.810 --> 01:30:06.153
And so that life can continue in this unique jewel.

01:30:21.045 --> 01:30:21.225
Let

01:30:21.265 --> 01:30:22.807
us cherish our common good.

01:30:24.427 --> 01:30:24.908
Our sea.

